        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193167_537105_23709"/>
        <body>A PartShapeElement is a type of ShapeElement. A PartShapeElement represents an element of the shape of a PartView, a ProductConfiguration or another PartShapeElement.</body>
